      en: ["Madlangampisi is located at the major road junction of the MR5 and MR24 highways.", "The town is situated approximately 30 kilometers from the town of Tshaneni.", "The Madlangampisi Clinic serves a population of over 10,000 in the region.", "The area is recognized for its traditional pottery craftsmanship.", "The Komati River is utilized here for several communal irrigation schemes.", "The settlement is a key stop for public transport services heading north."],
